byte2` helpers.\n- Helper functions `do_callout`, `match_ref`, `recurse_update_offsets`, plus `do_bumpalong` for next_match, are translated as private `unsafe fn`s.\n- Whitespace `HSPACE_CASES`/`VSPACE_CASES`, `UCD_ANY_I`/`UCD_FOLD_I_TURKISH`, `IS_NEWLINE`/`WAS_NEWLINE` (using `mb`), and the UTF char macros are implemented as local helpers/inline logic. `PCRE2_ASSERT`/`UNREACHABLE` are no-ops.\n\n### Notes\n- `PCRE2_ERROR_UTF8_ERR20` is not present in `pcre2_internal.rs`, so I defined it locally as `-22` (matching `pcre2_valid_utf.rs`'s local definition).\n- I did not add the `pub mod pcre2_match;` declaration to `lib.rs` (per instructions); the caller must register the module. I temporarily added it only to compile/test, then reverted `lib.rs`, `Cargo.toml`, and removed the temporary test."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":384,"cache_read_input_tokens":379844,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":384,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01MByBnnEu5LkGZfp5zwCNA4","session_id":"f08167af-b65d-45d4-8780-bbe04557b3d8","uuid":"9442f629-b7a1-4171-8061-49cd3de83c89","timestamp":"2026-08-05T05:35:18.793Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Translate pcre2_match.c chunked"}
